      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/payneway_arkansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town lies in the Arkansas Delta, where flat, fertile alluvial soils—silt loams—support highly productive agriculture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
