      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/payneway_arkansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Payneway experiences a humid subtropical climate, with hot, humid summers, mild winters, and about 50 inches of evenly distributed rainfall each year.",
